<title>USA: Lydall sees 1997 Q1 similar to 1996 Q1.</title>
<headline>Lydall sees 1997 Q1 similar to 1996 Q1.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, Conn. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lydall Inc said Wednesday it believes first quarter results will be similar those of the 1996 first quarter, which would be lower than analysts' estimates.</p>
<p>In the first quarter of 1996 the company reported earnings of $0.33 per share. First Call projects earnings of $0.36 per share for the 1997 first quarter.</p>
<p>The company said it sees more of its growth coming in the second half of 1997.</p>
</text>
